# Line endings

- Follow the repository `.editorconfig`: save edited text files with Windows CRLF line endings and a final newline.
- When editing an existing file, normalize the whole file so Visual Studio does not report mixed line endings.
- Preserve the file's existing encoding and byte order mark, if any.
